      "description": "Member of the IBM i I/O team where I have been involved in the following:\n* Project lead developing and testing a native device driver for a 2 port 16 Gb Fibre Channel adapter.\n* Developed and tested an SR-IOV device driver for a 2x10G/2x1G Ethernet adapter.\n* Developed and tested a native device driver for a 4 port 1G Ethernet adapter.\n* Developed and tested Link Aggregation support on IBM i.\n* Developed and tested Layer 2 Bridging support on IBM i.",
